OL,3,GNEWSATeen 'detached from reality' to
OL,4,Acope with return of aggressive cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Through it all I tried to stay as
OL,7,Fpositive as I could," said Ethan,
OL,8,Fadding it was his dad Lloyd, also a
OL,9,Fcancer survivor, who was often "losing
OL,10,Fhis head".
